### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

###

### Get Forecast - Example 1 (Moscow)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/forecast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "birthTime": "14:30",
  "birthPlace": "Москва"
}

###

### Get Forecast - Example 2 (New York with coordinates)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/forecast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birthDate": "1985-12-25",
  "birthTime": "08:00",
  "birthPlace": "New York",
  "latitude": 40.7128,
  "longitude": -74.0060,
  "timezone": -5
}

###

### Get Forecast - Example 3 (London)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/forecast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birthDate": "1992-03-10",
  "birthTime": "18:45",
  "birthPlace": "London"
}

###

### Root endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/
